      <mxCell id="banner" value="Data Residency: All components in ap-south-1. Browser receives NL answers only — never raw data.  |  Security: AWS WAF web ACL on Amplify (rate limit + AWS managed rules; global CloudFront scope required by Amplify Firewall — config only, no program data), Aurora private, Tool Lambda SELECT-only, least-privilege IAM." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#82B366;fillColor=#EAF5E2;fontColor=#1B4D1B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
